<Description>
<![CDATA[Steam Properties]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[Corrected input range checks.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.

This instruction calculates the Enthalpy, Entropy and Specific
Volume (1/density) for steam (or water) at the given Pressure
and Temperature.

Steam properties are calculated to IAPWS-IF97 as closely as
possible using single-precision math.

The allowable input range includes Temperatures from 0 to 800 C
(32 to 1472 F) at Pressures from 0 to 100 MPa (0 to 14503.77 PSIA)
and Temperatures from 0 to 2000 C (0 to 3632 F) at Pressures from
0 to 50 MPa (0 to 7251.885 PSIA).]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
</EncodedData>
</AddOnInstructionDefinitions>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
